                                            <SD SI="Repair_Action" TI="TI_1252081773">Check or replace EWP</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Enable_Conditions" TI="TI_1315105257">Ignition ON or ECC is awake</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Type" TI="TI_1660869490">Continuous</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Rate" TI="TI_603488216">100ms</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_42919384">EWP_RD_OverCurrWarn == Over current</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_1212317212">EWP_RD_OverCurrWarn == No Over current</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Limp_home_Action" TI="TI_1831850901">1.Send the fault code; 
2.wait for EWP return to normal</SD>
                                            <SD SI="DTC_Aged_Crieria" TI="TI_1121502405">40 times driving cycle</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_1079155795">1. If the current of the pump is too high, the pump is overloaded or the pump is abnormal.
